  "description": "Adds an AI Media Assistant to the Umbraco (v17+) Media section. It finds images with missing alt text, generic file names, or in the wrong folder, and uses a vision-capable AI model (via Umbraco.AI) to suggest a better file name, alt text, caption, and folder. You review and edit every suggestion in a table, then apply the ones you want — nothing is changed automatically.",
